  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3) Yanit Analiz\n\n**Girilecek credential / ayarlar:**\n1. `IMAP: Gelen Kutusu` node -> **IMAP** credential\n   (Gmail icin uygulama sifresi; host `imap.gmail.com`, port `993`).\n2. `Panel Ayarlari` node -> `panelBaseUrl` ve `panelKey` alanlarini\n   panelin `.env` dosyasindaki `PANEL_BASE_URL` ve `PANEL_SHARED_KEY`\n   degerleriyle **elle** doldurun.\n   n8n Docker'da ise: `http://host.docker.internal:4000`\n3. `Groq: Siniflandir` node -> **Header Auth** credential:\n   - Name: `Authorization`\n   - Value: `Bearer <GROQ_API_KEY>`  (console.groq.com, ucretsiz)\n4. `Discord: Bildir` node -> **Discord Webhook** credential\n   (Discord kanal ayarlari > Integrations > Webhooks).\n\nModel: `openai/gpt-oss-20b` (degistirmeyin).\nPanelde bulunmayan bir adresten gelen mail sessizce yoksayilir.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-Kurulum Notu",
      "name": "Kurulum Notu",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -340,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "format": "simple",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "imap-trigger",
      "name": "IMAP: Gelen Kutusu",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        280,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "CREDENTIAL: IMAP hesabi (gonderim yaptiginiz kutu).",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "credentials": {
        "imap": {
          "id": "MrzdnUh6sGNCEbGL",
          "name": "LeadBot IMAP (DOLDUR: user + password)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "set-base-url",
              "name": "panelBaseUrl",
              "value": "http://localhost:4000",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-panel-key",
              "name": "panelKey",
              "value": "BURAYA_PANEL_SHARED_KEY_YAZIN",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-ayarlar",
      "name": "Panel Ayarlari",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        500,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "ELLE DOLDURUN: PANEL_BASE_URL ve PANEL_SHARED_KEY.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// IMAP'ten gelen maili sadelestirir.\nconst d = items[0].json;\n\nconst fromRaw = d.from || (d.headers && d.headers.from) || \"\";\nconst eslesme = String(fromRaw).match(/[^\\s<>@]+@[^\\s<>@]+\\.[^\\s<>@]+/);\nconst gonderen = eslesme ? eslesme[0].toLowerCase() : \"\";\n\nlet metin = d.text || d.textPlain || \"\";\nif (!metin && d.html) metin = String(d.html).replace(/<[^>]*>/g, \" \");\n\n// Alintilanan onceki mail zincirini kes - AI sadece yeni yaniti gorsun.\nmetin = String(metin)\n  .split(/^\\s*(?:>|On .+wrote:|-----Original Message-----)/m)[0]\n  .replace(/\\s+/g, \" \")\n  .trim()\n  .slice(0, 4000);\n\nif (!gonderen) throw new Error(\"Gonderen adresi cozulemedi.\");\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    panelBaseUrl: $(\"Panel Ayarlari\").first().json.panelBaseUrl,\n    panelKey: $(\"Panel Ayarlari\").first().json.panelKey,\n    gonderen,\n    konu: d.subject || \"\",\n    metin,\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "code-yanit",
      "name": "Yaniti Hazirla",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.panelBaseUrl }}/api/leads/lookup",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $json.gonderen }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-panel-key",
              "value": "={{ $json.panelKey }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-lookup",
      "name": "Lead'i Bul",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        940,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "Panelde olmayan adres 404 doner; akis IF ile burada durur.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
